9. Health, Safety & Wellbeing
9. Health, Safety & Wellbeing

In line with the Health and Safety at Work etc. Act 1974, the Company will provide a safe working environment, display screen equipment assessments, and access to a free, confidential Employee Assistance Programme (EAP) available 24/7.

Questions about this policy should be directed to hr-uk@meridiantech.example or your HR Business Partn